 "strings": {
  "(If I'm going to infiltrate KJ Art, now would be my chance while Kaito-san has them distracted.)": "",
  "(I have to rescue Seiya's sister before the recess ends.)": "",
  "(I have to rescue Seiya's sister before they notice me!)": "",
  "(I should be looking on the higher floors.)": "",
  "(Doesn't look like I can open this door. Better look for another way.)": "",
  "(I should explore this floor a little more.)": "",
  "(All right, time to look for the blueprints.)": "",
  "(Okay. I found the blueprints.)": "",
  "(...Hm?)": "",
  "(Looks like you need a key to get to the stairs on the third floor.)": "",
  "(I won't be able to get to the room Murase's in.)": "",
  "(Sounds like someone's pretty pissed up there.)": "",
  "(That's a good question...)": "",
  "(A warehouse... Might be something useful in there. Could try to get in if I have time, but...)": "",
  "(Almost there. Hold out a little longer, Kaito-san!)": "",
  "(What should I show them?)": "",
  "(This!)": "",
  "(They probably have a lot of\nimportant conversations around here.)": "",
  "(The underside of the table... That's a perfect spot. It'd be hard to find a bug there.)": "",
  "(Okay, I'll put one there.)": "",
  "(...Not sure where I'd hide a bug on a sofa, though.)": "",
  "(It'd be too suspicious if I tried to hide it underneath.)": "",
  "(I should find somewhere else.)": "",
  "(I guess people might spill secrets near the safe.)": "",
  "(Trying to plant a bug there might draw\nsome unwanted attention, though.)": "",
  "(This hole is still here?)": "",
  "(A long time ago I had a fight with Matsugane-san and accidentally hit the wall.)": "",
  "(I was surprised at how fragile it was.)": "",
  "(Got a faceful of Matsugane-san's fist after that, too.)": "",
  "(That hurt so much it made me dizzy.)": "",
  "(Matsugane-san...)": "",
  "(Younger members use this phone all the time.\nThis is the perfect spot.)": "",
  "(Okay, I'll put a bug behind this desk.)": "",
  "(Matsugane-san's desk... If there are important discussions, this is where to have them.)": "",
  "(That said, it might be too suspicious if a lower rank yakuza goes near his desk.)": "",
  "(Oh well. I'll have to give up on this and look for another place.)": "",
  "(Kaito-san taught me how to pray\nwith one of these years ago.)": "",
  "(Bow twice, clap twice, then bow again.)": "",
  "(He said any Japanese person worth their salt\nshould know how to do it.)": "",
  "(I don't think these Matsugane guys are spilling\ntheir family secrets to the gods, though.)": "",
  "(What about these lockers?)": "",
  "(I could probably hear what goes on\nat Matsugane-san's desk if I toss a bug in there.)": "",
  "(But he's the only one with the keys.)": "",
  "(It'd be way too suspicious\nif I tried to pick the lock, too.)": "",
  "(Oh well. I should find somewhere else.)": "",
  "(I already looked here. I should look somewhere else.)": "",
  "(Power outlet's a pretty standard bug spot.)": "",
  "(Nobody'll notice if there's one extra plug in there.)": "",
  "(Guess this is as good a place as any.)": "",
  "(Gotta find a key somehow.)": "",
  "(This is the security room, so the key might be around here. I should take a look around.)": "",
  "(What's this?)": "",
  "(Guess the key's in this room somewhere.)": "",
  "(But where? I should look for it.)": "",
  "(This safe...)": "",
  "(The note on the desk said to keep the key \"under high security.\")": "",
  "(Not much higher security than a safe.)": "",
  "(Let's see here...)": "",
  "(Damn, I need a code.)": "",
  "(Lemme see if I can find a hint around here.)": "",
  "(Could this be...)": "",
  "(The code to the safe?)": "",
  "(Guess I'll try it out.)": "",
  "(Damn, that's not it. Gotta look harder.)": "",
  "(Oh! It opened!)": "",
  "(Great. Now I can get through that door. Time to find Murase.)": "",
  "This is the search screen.": "",
  "Try putting something in there. Let's start with the name.": "",
  "Then, lets try narrowing the search period. For now I'll have it just look at today.": "",
  "See? You can see where people have posted messages to Chatter from on the map.": "",
  "128 hits, though... That's kind of a lot. We have to narrow it down some more.": "",
  "Put in anything else you know about them. You said the name of the club just now, didn't you?": "",
  "Club Amour in Kamurocho.": "",
  "Okay. Try searching for \"Aragaki\" and \"Club Amour\".": "",
  "Bingo. We narrowed it down to one.": "",
  "So Aragaki wrote this, huh?": "",
  "No. It's someone else who says they saw him.": "",
  "This message is from 10 minutes ago. He might still be around.": "",
  "He might be able to tell you where Aragaki went.": "",
  "(I'll have to figure out the cause of death first. No matter how you look at it, this here must be it...)": "",
  "And if we can figure out who it was, Hamura'll be off the hook.": "",
  "(The cause of death was severe brain trauma, directly through the eye sockets. Weapon must've been long and pointed, like an ice pick.)": "",
  "(Did they gouge his eyes out to make an example out of him? Or was it something else...?)": "",
  "(Something's not right. If this is where the murder happened, then something's missing.)": "",
  "(There's not even a drop of blood near the body.)": "",
  "(It's highly likely Kume was killed somewhere else.)": "",
  "(The body wasn't here at 2 AM when someone from another bar took the trash out.)": "",
  "(In other words, Kume got dumped sometime between 2 and 6 AM, when the body was found.)": "",
  "(Come to think of it, what happened to the victim's possessions, like wallet or cellphone...?)": "",
  "(Nothing was found in Kume's pockets. No wallet, no phone, nothing.)": "",
  "Victim was a Kansai thug, bottom feeder with the Kyorei Clan. Toshiro Kume.": "",
  "Body had a few bruises, but the cause of death is pretty obvious. Two puncture wounds, straight through the eyes.": "",
  "The cops think the murderer used something like an ice pick, pierced right into his brain.": "",
  "Looks like the murder weapon went through Kume's eyes, then tore 'em out when the killer took it back.": "",
  "Only natural to think the Tojo was trying to make an example out of him. You know, threaten the Kyorei. Get them to back out of Kamurocho.": "",
  "So, even if Hamura didn't do it, it's damn likely that <font_kind=yakuza_italic>someone</font_kind> from the Tojo Clan did.": "",
  "What, find the real killer? That's a step too far.": "",
  "Priority number one is proving his alibi. We do that, we're in the clear.": "",
  "There was pretty much no blood anywhere near the body.": "",
  "Meaning Kume didn't get murdered in that alley.": "",
  "If I had to guess, I'd say he died in Amour.": "",
  "Night of the crime, an employee from another bar tossed their trash out in this alley. 'Round 2 AM.": "",
  "Didn't see anything out of the ordinary, though.": "",
  "In other words, Kume got dumped sometime between 2 and 6 AM, when the body was found.": "",
  "Nothing was found in Kume's pockets. No wallet, no phone, nothing.": "",
  "Bet the murderer broke the phone. The cops tried one of those \"find my phone\" things, but came up empty-handed.": "",
  "Guess the killer at least <font_kind=yakuza_italic>tried</font_kind> to cover his tracks.": "",
  "These just suddenly came falling down. Thank god no one got hurt.": "",
  "Welcome to the blackjack table, ladies and gentlemen.": "",
  "I wish you all the best of luck.": "",
  "Welcome to the blackjack table, sir. Shall we play head-to-head?": "",
  "Please select Bet or Re-bet to place a wager.": "",
  "Here are your cards.": "",
  "The dealer pulled a green card. Time to shuffle the deck.": "",
  "It appears you lack the chips, sir. Come back once you've exchanged for more.": "",
  "It's your turn, sir. What would you like to do?": "",
  "You bust. How unfortunate.": "",
  "It's the dealer's turn.": "",
  "The dealer's total is below 17. Drawing another card.": "",
  "The dealer has 17.": "",
  "The dealer has 18.": "",
  "The dealer has 19.": "",
  "The dealer has 20.": "",
  "The dealer has 21.": "",
  "The dealer has blackjack.": "",
  "The dealer busts.": "",
  "The dealer's revealed card is an ace. It may be blackjack.": "",
  "The dealer does not have blackjack. Let's move on.": "",
  "You have blackjack! Congratulations!": "",
  "Unfortunately, the dealer has blackjack as well. Better luck next time, sir.": "",
  "I look forward to your return.": "",
  "It appears you lack the chips, sir. Come back once you've exchanged for more.  ": "",
  "(The item's effect has worn off.)": "",
  "You won the last game. The maximum bet has increased to 300 chips.": "",
  "You won two games in a row. The maximum bet has increased to 500 chips.": "",
  "You won three games in a row. The maximum bet has increased to 1,000 chips.": "",
  "You won the last game. The maximum bet has increased to 3,000 chips.": "",
  "You won two games in a row. The maximum bet has increased to 5,000 chips.": "",
  "You won three games in a row. The maximum bet has increased to 10,000 chips.": "",
  "You are on quite a roll, sir.": "",
  "You are doing great, sir.": "",
  "The dealer wins. Shall we start the next round?": "",
  "The dealer wins this showdown.": "",
  "A draw, sir. Shall we start the next round?": "",
  "A draw, sir.": "",
  "One hand is a draw, sir.": "",
  "You win, sir. Shall we start the next round?": "",
  "You win this showdown, sir.": "",
  "You win, sir.": "",
  "One of your hands has won, sir.": "",
  "Both of your hands have won, sir.": "",
  "The dealer has won against both of your hands.": "",
  "Both of your hands have won, sir. One of them was a Six Card Charlie. Impressive.": "",
  "Both of your hands have won, sir. Both hands were Six Card Charlies as well. Quite an impressive victory.": "",
  "One of your hands has won, sir. Well done on the Six Card Charlie.": "",
  "You have drawn six cards without busting, sir. That is a Six Card Charlie. You win.": "",
  "You made the right call buying insurance, sir. Well done.": "",
  "Would you like to play another round?": "",
  "If you bet 500 chips, I'll set a triple payout. You'll win 5x for blackjack and 2x for a Double Down. Care to play?": "",
  "If you bet 2,000 chips, I'll set a triple payout. You'll win 5x for blackjack and 2x for a Double Down. Care to play?": "",
  "Draw another card and add it to your total.": "",
  "Stay with your current hand.": "",
  "Double your bet and draw another card. You cannot draw again after this.": "",
  "Split your pair into two separate hands, each the value of your original bet.": "",
  "Forfeit this hand. Half of your original bet will be returned to you.": "",
  "As the dealer has a possible blackjack, you may take out insurance equal to half of your original bet.": "",
  "Bet chips within the bet limit.": "",
  "Bet the same number of chips as last round.": "",
  "Regular blackjack.\nReward: 2,000 chips": "",
  "No 2s, 3s, or 4s in the deck.\nReward: 2,500 chips": "",
  "No 7s, 8s, or 9s in the deck.\nReward: 2,000 chips": "",
  "No Js, Qs, or Ks in the deck.\nReward: 4,000 chips": "",
  "Welcome to the blackjack tutorial. This session will last for three rounds, so please stick around.": "",
  "The point of blackjack is to make the sum of your cards as close to 21 as possible.": "",
  "The \"Total\" you see here displays the total of the cards you currently have.": "",
  "Selecting \"Hit\" will draw a card.": "",
  "Selecting \"Double Down\" will also draw a card, but you cannot hit again after doing so.": "",
  "Select Hit or Double Down to draw a card.": "",
  "If you think your total may exceed 21 if you draw another card, select \"Stand\" to stay at your current total.": "",
  "Your turn. Ah, you have two Queens. It's important to note here that all face cards are worth 10 points.": "",
  "By selecting \"Split,\" you will spit a pair into two hands that you play individually. Both will be the original value.": "",
  "These actions will get you through a normal round, the results of which will be reflected in your chip total.": "",
  "The dealer's revealed card is an ace. They may have blackjack.": "",
  "Try taking insurance this round.": "",
  "If your insurance bet succeeds, you'll make your original bet back.": "",
  "Otherwise, the round will continue as normal.": "",
  "If your chances look slim, you can select \"Surrender\" to retire from the round and reclaim half of your original bet.": "",
  "One more rule. Drawing six cards without busting is called a Six Card Charlie, and you win automatically.": "",
  "This concludes our tutorial. Please enjoy your time at the casino.": "",
  "Select \"Bet\" to choose how many chips you'd like to wager.": "",
  "Let's play another round. Select \"Bet\" to choose how many chips to wager, or \"Re-Bet\" to wager the same as last round.": "",
  "This is the final game. Select \"Bet\" to choose how many chips to wager, or \"Re-Bet\" to wager the same as last round.": "",
  "Welcome to the poker table, ladies and gentlemen.": "",
  "Choose a card to discard.": "",
  "Today I'll be guiding you through the rules of Pineapple Hold'em, a variant of Texas Hold'em.": "",
  "In regular Texas Hold'em, the goal is to form the best hand using the two cards in your hand and five community cards.": "",
  "In Pineapple Hold'em, however, you will be given three cards in your hand instead of the normal two.": "",
  "Discard one of the three cards in your hand to arrive at the requisite two.": "",
  "First take a look at the remaining two cards in your hand, then select Check to end the round.": "",
  "All players have bet the same amount, so the game continues to the next round.": "",
  "At this point, community cards are dealt. Take a look at the community cards.": "",
  "One of your cards has the same value as a community card. Hence, you have one pair.": "",
  "The player to your right has opted to bet and increased the bet amount. They may be feeling confident in their hand.": "",
  "Now it's up to you to raise (increase the bet), call (match the bet), or fold (quit). You cannot fold on this hand.": "",
  "At this point, another community card is dealt.": "",
  "However, you still only have one pair.": "",
  "When your hand is not particularly strong, it may be wise to cut your losses and select Fold to opt out of the round.": "",
  "But since you do have a pair at least, let's continue for now.": "",
  "This is the final round. All community cards have been dealt.": "",
  "Lucky you, the last community card has increased the value of your hand to two pairs. Try your luck and select Raise.": "",
  "Congratulations, you win. You take all the chips that were bet over the course of the game.": "",
  "Remember: Bet or raise when you're feeling confident, check if you want to see how things play out, or fold to bow out.": "",
  "This concludes the tutorial. Please enjoy all of the games we have to offer.": "",
  "Today I'll be guiding you through the rules of Omaha Hold'em, a variant of Texas Hold'em.": "",
  "The rules are generally consistent between the two games, but your hand consists of four cards instead of two.": "",
  "As always, the aim is to create the best possible hand using your hand cards and the community cards.": "",
  "At the end of the game, you will select two of your hand cards and three community cards to create a five-card hand.": "",
  "You have two fives: one pair.": "",
  "A four has been drawn. You now have two pairs.": "",
  "The final card was a five. Use two cards in hand and three community cards to create the best possible hand.": "",
  "You have a full house. Select Raise and try your luck.": "",
  "Today I'll be guiding you through the rules of Texas Hold'em.": "",
  "The game starts with every player being dealt their two hand cards.": "",
  "A sugoroku message test. \nA sugoroku message test.": "",
  "Welcome to virtual Kamurocho! Throw them dice n' go for the goal!": "",
  "Pressing <symbol=button_decide> will roll the dice. Press <symbol=button_decide> again to stop the dice!": "",
  "Here's a gift for you.": "",
  "Take this gift, okay?": "",
  "Here's a li'l somethin' fer ya.": "",
  "Here's a silver plate.": "",
  "Here's a gift.": "",
  "Take this Silver Plate.": "",
  "I picked this up. Here, it's a Silver Plate.": "",
  "Thank you for your patronage!": "",
  "I'll give you a Copper Plate.": "",
  "Here's a gift from me.": "",
  "Welcome to Paradise VR!": "",
  "Sir, do you have Play Passes? Each course costs a different number of Play Passes.": "",
  "(Umm... isn't that the thing the homeless guy gave me?)": "",
  "Is this a Play Pass?": "",
  "Oh, a free trial Play Pass! You can play with just one of these.": "",
  "Have you played Dice & Cube before?": "",
  "No, this is my first time.": "",
  "I'll guide you through the Short Course today.": "",
  "Customers who do well on the Short Course will get a special surprise.": "",
  "The condition is to clear the stage with more than two dice left in your possession. Do your best!": "",
  "(Is this what that homeless guy wanted?)": "",
  "(Guess I'd better beat the game and bring him back the prize.)": "",
  "That's all there is to it. Now please put on these VR goggles...": "",
  "And you're all set! Enjoy your trip to virtual Kamurocho!": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Welcome to the blackjack table, ladies and gentlemen.": "ยินดีต้อนรับสู่โต๊ะแบล็กแจ็กค่ะ ท่านผู้มีเกียรติทุกท่าน",
  "I wish you all the best of luck.": "ขอให้ทุกท่านโชคดีค่ะ",
  "Welcome to the blackjack table, sir. Shall we play head-to-head?": "ยินดีต้อนรับสู่โต๊ะแบล็กแจ็กค่ะ ท่านต้องการเล่นแบบตัวต่อตัวไหมคะ?",
  "Please select Bet or Re-bet to place a wager.": "กรุณาเลือก Bet หรือ Re-Bet เพื่อวางเดิมพัน",
  "Here are your cards.": "นี่คือไพ่ของท่านค่ะ",
  "It appears you lack the chips, sir. Come back once you've exchanged for more.": "ดูเหมือนท่านมีชิปไม่พอค่ะ กรุณากลับมาใหม่หลังจากแลกชิปเพิ่มนะคะ",
  "It's your turn, sir. What would you like to do?": "ถึงตาท่านแล้วค่ะ ท่านต้องการทำอะไรคะ?",
  "You bust. How unfortunate.": "ท่านไพ่บอดค่ะ น่าเสียดายจริง ๆ",
  "It's the dealer's turn.": "ถึงตาดีลเลอร์แล้วค่ะ",
  "The dealer's total is below 17. Drawing another card.": "แต้มของดีลเลอร์ต่ำกว่า 17 จั่วไพ่เพิ่มอีกใบค่ะ",
  "The dealer has 17.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้ 17 แต้มค่ะ",
  "The dealer has 18.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้ 18 แต้มค่ะ",
  "The dealer has 19.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้ 19 แต้มค่ะ",
  "The dealer has 20.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้ 20 แต้มค่ะ",
  "The dealer has 21.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้ 21 แต้มค่ะ",
  "The dealer has blackjack.": "ดีลเลอร์ได้แบล็กแจ็กค่ะ",
  "The dealer busts.": "ดีลเลอร์แต้มเกินค่ะ",
  "The dealer's revealed card is an ace. It may be blackjack.": "ไพ่เปิดของดีลเลอร์เป็นเอซค่ะ อาจจะเป็นแบล็กแจ็กก็ได้",
  "The dealer does not have blackjack. Let's move on.": "ดีลเลอร์ไม่ได้แบล็กแจ็กค่ะ ไปกันต่อเลยค่ะ",
  "You have blackjack! Congratulations!": "ท่านได้แบล็กแจ็ก! ขอแสดงความยินดีด้วยค่ะ!",
  "Unfortunately, the dealer has blackjack as well. Better luck next time, sir.": "เสียใจด้วยค่ะ ดีลเลอร์ได้แบล็กแจ็กเหมือนกัน ขอให้โชคดีในรอบหน้านะคะ",
  "I look forward to your return.": "หวังว่าจะได้พบท่านอีกนะคะ",
  "(The item's effect has worn off.)": "(ฤทธิ์ของไอเทมหมดแล้วสินะ)",
  "You are on quite a roll, sir.": "ดวงท่านกำลังขึ้นเลยนะครับ",
  "You are doing great, sir.": "ท่านเล่นได้ดีมากเลยครับ",
  "The dealer wins. Shall we start the next round?": "ดีลเลอร์ชนะค่ะ ต้องการเริ่มรอบต่อไปไหมคะ?",
